  "question": {
    "text": "The output Y of the logic circuit given below is <img src=\"assets\\qt0025_97a0a621b386.png\">"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\bar{A}+B$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\bar{A}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\overline{(\\overline A+B)} \\cdot \\bar{A}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\overline{(\\overline A+B)} \\cdot A$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0025_f9f9425b9237.png\">\r\n\r\nBy absorption laws\r\n$$\r\nY=\\bar{A}+\\bar{A} \\cdot B\r\n$$\r\nor $\\quad Y=(\\bar{A} \\cdot B)+\\bar{A}=\\bar{A} \\cdot(B+1)=\\bar{A} \\cdot 1=\\bar{A}$"
  }
}